        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the strangest side characters ever, each with unique perks. Adapt to every characters strong and weak points and find the best 4-7 weapon combination to survive hostile magical enviroments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910120/extras/3582b5f1278b88f97206056c30be23a0.poster.avif?t=1775500327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910120/extras/3582b5f1278b88f97206056c30be23a0.webm?t=1775500327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910120/extras/3582b5f1278b88f97206056c30be23a0.mp4?t=1775500327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast runs (15 minutes of surviving + Boss fight )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 Characters on release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Weapons, each with synergies and evolutions ( Fire wands, Thunders, Revolvers, Black holes, a Stick and a bubble gun? )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous Sidequests for extra rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different maps with unique enemy waves and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ achievements and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the strangest side characters ever, each with unique perks. Adapt to every characters strong and weak points and find the best 4-7 weapon combination to survive hostile magical enviroments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910120/extras/3582b5f1278b88f97206056c30be23a0.poster.avif?t=1775500327\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910120/extras/3582b5f1278b88f97206056c30be23a0.webm?t=1775500327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910120/extras/3582b5f1278b88f97206056c30be23a0.mp4?t=1775500327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast runs (15 minutes of surviving + Boss fight )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 Characters on release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Weapons, each with synergies and evolutions ( Fire wands, Thunders, Revolvers, Black holes, a Stick and a bubble gun? )</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Scaling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous Sidequests for extra rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different maps with unique enemy waves and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ achievements and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li></ul>",
